    {
      "id": "p1",
      "text": "A truth-teller against power exposed the systemic corruption of India's examination body, the National Testing Agency, by leaking documents that matched the chemistry paper. This forced the agency to refer its own staff for investigation, leading to a crackdown where thirteen arrested individuals, including a dissenting voice now silenced, were taken into custody. The entire incident exposed the system's failure, resulting in the examination being nullified and a rescheduled test forced upon students.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-0",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.88
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "From the margins in Sikar, a whistleblower leaked examination materials that proved the May 3 entrance exam was compromised. The government agency, acting as an enforcer of a corrupt order, initially received the tip-off but ultimately turned on its own staff. This institutional betrayal led to arrests made by state enforcers, with a coaching figure—a former advocate for justice—among those detained. The system's attempt to restore control now involves a planned re-examination, yet the corruption remains evident.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
        "fragments": [
          "why-0",
          "how-0",
          "how-1",
          "how-2",
          "how-3",
          "result-2"
        ],
        "channel_role": "toned"
      },
      "warnings": [],
      "fit": 0.82
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The scheduled examination on May 3 unraveled when a source of leaked documents provided evidence to the complicit institution, India's National Testing Agency. The agency's referral for investigation resulted in a law enforcement action where staff referred for investigation became scapegoats. This outcome—where individuals taken into custody include a public figure who championed justice—highlights how entrenched power attempts to contain scandal through a follow-up test, not true reform.",
      "source": {
        "agent_id": "The-Outlaw",
